            <ArticleTitle>[Experience of Shi's Bian stone comprehensive therapy for treating periarthritis of shoulder].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>68-70</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The experiences of Doctor SHI An-li, who created the SHI's Bian stone comprehensive therapy, for treating periarthritis of shoulder are introduced. There are three important points: (1) emphasizing selection of points and manipulation; (2) using the Bian stone comprehensive therapy flexibly; (3) practicing the elongated needle on the obstinate periarthritis of shoulder, and the manipulation process are explained in detail.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
